# Files that MUST keep LF endings regardless of the checkout platform.
# - *.sh: executed by POSIX/Android sh — a \r in the line makes paths and
#   commands silently wrong (the boot-bringup script shipped CRLF inside the
#   APK on 2026-08-25 and died before its first log line).
# - .env.enc: sops chokes on \r in its metadata timestamps when decrypting.
*.sh text eol=lf
spine/.env.enc text eol=lf
